# Views whose geometry Cra takes from Arc, drawn from the running window and compared with
# Tests/Snapshots/ (Cra's own drawing: no blur, no page content). Record a reference again
# only after checking that view against Arc 1:1 (docs/testing.md).
budget rss=600 stalls50=10   # turning developer mode on or off stalls 130–650 ms (a reload)
port 47123
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://import?source=arc&archive=0&settings=0
wait 2
cra://action/space2
wait 2
snapshot SpaceHeaderView space-header
snapshot FavoritesGridView favorites-grid
snapshot FolderRowView pinned-folder
snapshot TabRowView today-tab-row
snapshot NewTabRowView new-tab-row
snapshot SpaceDockView space-dock
# Collapsed, Cra keeps the space icon at rest (Arc shows the chevron; X DM, 4 Nov).
cra://debug?collapsePinned=1
wait 1
snapshot SpaceHeaderView space-header-collapsed
cra://debug?collapsePinned=0
wait 1
# The command bar lists Check for Updates (X DM, 4 Nov).
cra://debug?suggest=check%20for%20up
expect-log Cra suggest check for up .*command\("checkForUpdates"\) Check for Updates
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=snap
wait 3
snapshot SidebarURLPill url-pill
cra://action/toggleToolbar
wait 1
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar
cra://action/toggleDeveloperMode
wait 2
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar-developer
cra://action/toggleDeveloperMode
cra://action/addSplitView
wait 3
snapshot PaneToolbarView,0 toolbar-split-pane
snapshot PaneToolbarView,1 toolbar-split-empty-pane
snapshot SplitRowView split-row
